1
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,640
It's not me. I'm castrated.

2
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,280
I can't have children.

3
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,770
Xiao Han, are you crazy?

4
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,040
Someone is helping us
clear the game for free.

5
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,840
Why are you playing the saint now?

6
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,600
You really are bewitched
by this demon empress.

7
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,000
You denied it when I asked you just now.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:34,920
Now to save her,

9
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,400
are you going to
drag us all down with you?

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,000
Alum was added to this water.

11
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,840
Anyone's blood would blend in it.

12
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,600
Using such a dirty trick
to frame the current Empress Dowager,

13
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,800
Chief Eunuch,

14
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,160
the one who truly holds all the power

15
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,640
in this palace

16
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,100
is actually you, isn't it?

17
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,400
I see.

18
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,960
The pinnacle of power the system
mentioned isn't the Empress Dowager,

19
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,280
but this damn eunuch.

20
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,480
Not cool at all.

21
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,320
Whatever. I'll help you
take this guy down first.

22
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,520
We'll settle our score when we get back.

23
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,880
Nonsense!

24
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,840
Men!

25
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:05,200
Go fetch a bucket of clean water
from the deep well in the palace.

26
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,000
We test again.

27
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,360
Who would trust the water fetched

28
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,560
by your Imperial Household Department?

29
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:14,020
Whoever dares to take a step
out of this hall,

30
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,280
I'll break their legs first.

31
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,840
Since the Chief Eunuch thinks
clean water isn't clear enough,

32
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,440
let's test it with our lives.

33
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,840
Today, I bet my head

34
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,560
against your life,
Lord Nine Thousand Years.

35
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,720
Let's settle life and death

36
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,440
right here and test this bloodline

37
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:27,370
once and for all.

38
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,360
Oh no.

39
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,400
Your hand.

40
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,420
Are you worrying about me?

41
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:47,920
It's just a flesh wound. I won't die.

42
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,250
Focus on your business.

43
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,280
If you want to see him test the blood,

44
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,120
hold your swords steady for me.

45
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,000
Men, fetch one tael of pure coarse salt

46
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,039
and half a bowl of well water.

47
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:01,520
And bring me the most precise small scale
from the Imperial Hospital.

48
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:04,240
Today, in front of all the civil
and military officials,

49
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,000
I will weigh and show them

50
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,200
how royal blood should truly be tested.

51
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,280
Testing blood with clean water

52
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,680
has been a deadly scam
for a thousand years.

53
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,170
Because any clean water

54
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,800
will cause the blood to disperse.

55
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,320
As long as blood is dropped
into clean water,

56
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,240
it will blend.

57
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,720
Only in this

58
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:21,400
Jiuli salt water will the blood
maintain its true nature

59
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,040
and never mix.

60
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:28,760
This is called bloodline resonance.

61
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:32,360
This proves that I absolutely cannot be
the father of this child.

62
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,040
Great!

63
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,280
My innocence has been proven.

64
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,360
Chief Eunuch,

65
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,360
you lost.

66
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:42,560
Will you take off your own head,
or should I do it for you?

67
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,800
Lord Xiao's innocence is proven,

68
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:52,600
but whether this child has the true
dragon bloodline is still uncertain.

69
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,640
Since we must test it clearly today,

70
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,120
Empress Dowager,

71
00:02:57,320 --> 00:03:00,760
why don't you drop your blood
and test it yourself?

72
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,440
Test? No need to test.

73
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:13,690
This child is indeed not
of the late Emperor's blood.

74
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,920
Three months ago,

75
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,200
the real prince was just born,

76
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,520
and was smothered to death
in his swaddling clothes by you,

77
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,360
you castrated thief.

78
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,000
How dare you make such false accusations!

79
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,200
The royal bloodline is broken,

80
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,600
and the Iron Guards
will slaughter the palace.

81
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,360
If I hadn't bought a sick infant
overnight to take his place,

82
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:30,000
this empire would have fallen
into your hands long ago.

83
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,200
Nonsense!

84
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:35,120
Where is the evidence? Without evidence,
you are just a cornered dog

85
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,600
trying to cover up your crimes.

86
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,240
Grandpa Chief,

87
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:37,920
did you hear that?

88
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,720
This venomous woman admitted
to the fraud herself.

89
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,800
Quick, have the Iron Guards execute her.

90
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,200
I am the hero who exposed her.

91
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,530
I have done a great deed.

92
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,600
This is the blood letter
left by the midwife

93
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,440
who was silenced that night.

94
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,720
It clearly states

95
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:56,560
how the Chief Eunuch personally
smothered the real prince

96
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,000
to usurp the throne.

97
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,160
You Iron Guards

98
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,680
only recognize the royal bloodline.

99
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:04,200
And the chief culprit who truly
severed the royal bloodline

100
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,880
is not the Empress
who was forced to commit fraud,

101
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:07,760
but him.

102
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:10,920
The Chief Eunuch is
the traitor you should kill.

103
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Truth unlocked.

104
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,200
Judgment effective.

105
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,130
Locked onto the pinnacle of power.

106
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:18,360
The Chief Eunuch and all his subordinates

107
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,480
are to be executed immediately.

108
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:26,680
No, no, I am the Lord
of Nine Thousand Years.

109
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,680
How dare you!

110
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:35,200
The plan Your Ladyship entrusted to me
last night at the Kunning Palace,

111
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:37,200
I finally didn't mess it up.

112
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:40,440
That fool Chen Qiang thought
he caught us in adultery,

113
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:40,920
but didn't know

114
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:44,380
he became our pawn to force
the Chief Eunuch to turn against us.

115
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,280
Thank you.

116
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,320
I have exhausted my life
in this abyss of power.

117
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,200
Now it seems,

118
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:03,130
seeking survival is seeking entrapment.

119
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,760
I should rest.

120
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,640
Xiaofei,

121
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,480
please plead for me.

122
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,040
Ask Xiao Han to save me.

123
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,960
I taught you so much
in the company before.

124
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,360
You were always the most obedient, right?

125
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,600
I beg you.

126
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,800
Mr. Chen, I've had enough of you.

127
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:24,000
Go to hell with your bureaucratic airs.

128
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:40,920
The pinnacle of power has been killed.

129
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,200
The exit is open.

130
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,820
All players, please evacuate immediately.

131
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,040
Let's go!
